WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:07.500
Start with the current rate signals, then trace the increase components:
street-rate growth, year-over-year movement, and the prior-period change.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Review projected growth by service line as realized rates
move toward the Street Rate.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Then see how many residents fall into each recommended
in-house increase tier.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The portfolio view keeps every care level visible.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Finally, compare the saved rate plan
before publishing the new annual rate path.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.800
Record the combined recommendation and tier scenarios
for approval.